<title>FRANCE: France Telecom buys Etralie.</title>
<headline>France Telecom buys Etralie.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom SA said it is acquiring Etralie, a French company which installs trading systems and had 1996 sales of 250 million francs. A France Telecom spokesman declined to give the price of the transaction.</p>
</text>
